BT 1 0 0 1 0 41 Tm /F1 10 Tf 17 TL 1.21284 Tw (Vertical scaling means making one machine more powerful. More CPU, more RAM, faster disks, same) Tj T* 0 Tw .444431 Tw (single server. It is the easiest fix because it needs zero code changes. You are not touching your service) Tj T* 0 Tw (logic, your database calls, or your deployment pipeline. You are just renting a bigger box.) Tj T* ET
