BT 1 0 0 1 0 51 Tm /F1 9 Tf 15 TL (Retry keeps trying when a call fails. Circuit breaker stops trying after too many failures, so you are not wasting) Tj T* (threads on a service you already know is down. They work together. Retry handles occasional transient errors.) Tj T* (Circuit breaker handles sustained failures. In Spring Boot, Resilience4j gives you both through separate annotations) Tj T* (you can stack.) Tj T* ET
