BT 1 0 0 1 0 75 Tm /F1 10 Tf 17 TL .029676 Tw (One Kafka topic fans out to four independent workers. Each worker only knows about its own channel and its) Tj T* 0 Tw .618565 Tw (own provider, so a Twilio outage cannot slow down a single email. Redis and the Notification DB sit beside) Tj T* 0 Tw .758114 Tw (the pipeline rather than inside it: the API checks Redis, then writes the request and an outbox event to the) Tj T* 0 Tw 2.161899 Tw (DB, then each worker writes its own attempt back to the DB and checks Redis again before calling a) Tj T* 0 Tw (provider.) Tj T* ET
