BT 1 0 0 1 0 75 Tm /F1 10 Tf 17 TL .971098 Tw (upload-complete is the simpler flow to draw in an interview, the client tells you it is done. In production,) Tj T* 0 Tw .161984 Tw (many teams also subscribe to object storage event notifications, an S3 ObjectCreated event, and use that) Tj T* 0 Tw .766457 Tw (as a second, more reliable trigger for the same processing pipeline. That way, even if the client crashes) Tj T* 0 Tw .352209 Tw (right after uploading and never calls your API, the file is still picked up. Lead with upload-complete for the) Tj T* 0 Tw (interview, then mention storage events as the production hardening step.) Tj T* ET
