BT 1 0 0 1 0 75 Tm /F1 10 Tf 17 TL 1.313318 Tw (Metadata lives in PostgreSQL or MySQL because it is relational, small, and benefits from indexes and) Tj T* 0 Tw .862339 Tw (constraints. The actual file bytes go into object storage like S3, never into the database. Storing files as) Tj T* 0 Tw 1.275318 Tw (BLOBs works for a college assignment and falls apart the moment your database backups start taking) Tj T* 0 Tw .91436 Tw (hours because they are hauling around gigabytes of video content that has nothing to do with relational) Tj T* 0 Tw (data.) Tj T* ET
