.901961 .929412 .952941 rg
BT 1 0 0 1 14 355 Tm (1. Open with scope. Three users, three flows: customer orders, restaurant accepts, partner delivers. Say this) Tj T* ET
BT 1 0 0 1 14 342 Tm (first. 30 seconds.) Tj T* ET
BT 1 0 0 1 14 324 Tm (2. Mention the state machine immediately. The order moves through CREATED ) Tj /F3 9 Tf 10.8 TL (\256) Tj /F1 9 Tf 10.8 TL ( PAID ) Tj /F3 9 Tf 10.8 TL (\256) Tj /F1 9 Tf 10.8 TL ( PREPARING ) Tj /F3 9 Tf 10.8 TL (\256) Tj /F1 9 Tf 10.8 TL T* ET
BT 1 0 0 1 14 311 Tm (DELIVERY_ASSIGNED ) Tj /F3 9 Tf 10.8 TL (\256) Tj /F1 9 Tf 10.8 TL ( PICKED_UP ) Tj /F3 9 Tf 10.8 TL (\256) Tj /F1 9 Tf 10.8 TL ( DELIVERED. Only valid transitions are allowed. This one sentence) Tj T* ET
BT 1 0 0 1 14 298 Tm (separates a senior answer from a junior one. 30 seconds.) Tj T* ET
BT 1 0 0 1 14 280 Tm (3. Draw the architecture. Client ) Tj /F3 9 Tf 10.8 TL (\256) Tj /F1 9 Tf 10.8 TL ( API Gateway ) Tj /F3 9 Tf 10.8 TL (\256) Tj /F1 9 Tf 10.8 TL ( Order Service ) Tj /F3 9 Tf 10.8 TL (\256) Tj /F1 9 Tf 10.8 TL ( Kafka ) Tj /F3 9 Tf 10.8 TL (\256) Tj /F1 9 Tf 10.8 TL ( downstream services. Show) Tj T* ET
BT 1 0 0 1 14 267 Tm (PostgreSQL for orders, Redis for cache and location, Kafka for async events. 2 minutes.) Tj T* ET
BT 1 0 0 1 14 249 Tm (4. Walk through the full order flow. Placement, payment, restaurant response, delivery assignment, tracking.) Tj T* ET
BT 1 0 0 1 14 236 Tm (Use Kafka to connect each step asynchronously. 2 minutes.) Tj T* ET
BT 1 0 0 1 14 218 Tm (5. Call out the GPS problem. 4,000 pings per second cannot go into the orders table. Redis for current) Tj T* ET
BT 1 0 0 1 14 205 Tm (location, time-series or Kafka log for history. This detail stands out. 1 minute.) Tj T* ET
BT 1 0 0 1 14 187 Tm (6. Handle one failure in depth. Payment succeeds but order update fails. Idempotency key in Redis. Kafka) Tj T* ET
BT 1 0 0 1 14 174 Tm (event drives retry. More useful than listing five failures shallowly. 1.5 minutes.) Tj T* ET
BT 1 0 0 1 14 156 Tm (7. Close with one tradeoff. Immediate assignment vs assignment after restaurant acceptance. Pick one,) Tj T* ET
BT 1 0 0 1 14 143 Tm (explain your reasoning. 1.5 minutes.) Tj T* ET
