BT 1 0 0 1 14 388 Tm (1. Open with scope. "We are building video upload and processing: not recommendations or comments.) Tj T* ET
BT 1 0 0 1 14 375 Tm (Focus: creator uploads, backend coordinates, workers process, CDN serves." 30 seconds.) Tj T* ET
BT 1 0 0 1 14 357 Tm (2. State the key constraint immediately. "Video bytes should never go through Spring Boot API servers. The) Tj T* ET
BT 1 0 0 1 14 344 Tm (client uploads directly to object storage using a presigned URL." This one sentence shows you understand the) Tj T* ET
BT 1 0 0 1 14 331 Tm (core design. 30 seconds.) Tj T* ET
BT 1 0 0 1 14 313 Tm (3. Walk through the upload flow. upload-request returns presigned URL. Client uploads to S3. Client calls) Tj T* ET
BT 1 0 0 1 14 300 Tm (upload-complete. Backend verifies object exists. Status moves to UPLOAD_COMPLETE. OutboxEvent saved) Tj T* ET
BT 1 0 0 1 14 287 Tm (in same transaction. Publisher sends to Kafka after commit. 2 minutes.) Tj T* ET
BT 1 0 0 1 14 269 Tm (4. Explain the state machine. DRAFT ) Tj /F5 9 Tf 10.8 TL (\256) Tj /F1 9 Tf 10.8 TL ( UPLOAD_REQUESTED ) Tj /F5 9 Tf 10.8 TL (\256) Tj /F1 9 Tf 10.8 TL ( UPLOADING ) Tj /F5 9 Tf 10.8 TL (\256) Tj /F1 9 Tf 10.8 TL ( UPLOAD_COMPLETE) Tj T* ET
BT 1 0 0 1 14 256 Tm /F5 9 Tf 10.8 TL (\256) Tj /F1 9 Tf 10.8 TL ( PROCESSING ) Tj /F5 9 Tf 10.8 TL (\256) Tj /F1 9 Tf 10.8 TL ( READY. Only workers can set READY. FAILED and DELETED are terminal. 1 minute.) Tj T* ET
BT 1 0 0 1 14 238 Tm (5. Explain the processing pipeline. Workers receive VideoUploadedEvent from Kafka. Transcode to multiple) Tj T* ET
BT 1 0 0 1 14 225 Tm (resolutions. Mark READY after minimum outputs exist. Keep processing the rest in background. 2 minutes.) Tj T* ET
BT 1 0 0 1 14 207 Tm (6. Cover one failure. Transcoding worker crashes: Kafka offset not committed, worker restarts and) Tj T* ET
BT 1 0 0 1 14 194 Tm (reprocesses. Scheduled job finds stuck PROCESSING videos. 1.5 minutes.) Tj T* ET
BT 1 0 0 1 14 176 Tm (7. Close with one tradeoff. Sync vs async processing. Direct upload vs presigned URL. Outbox vs direct Kafka) Tj T* ET
BT 1 0 0 1 14 163 Tm (publish. Pick one and explain it clearly. 1.5 minutes.) Tj T* ET
