BT 1 0 0 1 14 180 Tm (Common Fresher Mistakes:) Tj T* ET
BT 1 0 0 1 14 162 Tm (- Using System.out.println everywhere instead of a real logging framework.) Tj T* ET
BT 1 0 0 1 14 149 Tm (- Not adding traceId/requestId, making cross-service debugging impossible.) Tj T* ET
BT 1 0 0 1 14 136 Tm (- Writing logs synchronously to a database inside the request path.) Tj T* ET
BT 1 0 0 1 14 123 Tm (- Storing all logs in a relational database instead of a search engine + archive.) Tj T* ET
BT 1 0 0 1 14 110 Tm (- Logging passwords, tokens, OTPs, or card numbers.) Tj T* ET
BT 1 0 0 1 14 97 Tm (- Leaving DEBUG logs enabled everywhere in production.) Tj T* ET
BT 1 0 0 1 14 84 Tm (- Not setting a retention policy, letting storage costs grow unbounded.) Tj T* ET
BT 1 0 0 1 14 71 Tm (- Not separating audit/security logs from regular application noise.) Tj T* ET
BT 1 0 0 1 14 58 Tm (- Making logs searchable only by raw message text instead of structured fields.) Tj T* ET
