BT 1 0 0 1 14 253 Tm (User code is untrusted. All of it.) Tj T* ET
BT 1 0 0 1 14 235 Tm (- Never run user code inside the main Spring Boot API server.) Tj T* ET
BT 1 0 0 1 14 222 Tm (- Run code inside an isolated container or VM with these constraints enforced:) Tj T* ET
BT 1 0 0 1 14 209 Tm (CPU time limit, wall clock limit, memory limit, process count limit,) Tj T* ET
BT 1 0 0 1 14 196 Tm (no outbound network access, read-only base filesystem, no write to shared paths.) Tj T* ET
BT 1 0 0 1 14 183 Tm (- Destroy the sandbox completely after execution completes or fails.) Tj T* ET
BT 1 0 0 1 14 170 Tm (- Hidden test case files should be read via stdin injection, not passed as file paths.) Tj T* ET
BT 1 0 0 1 14 157 Tm (- Judge workers must run on machines or nodes completely separate from the API tier.) Tj T* ET
BT 1 0 0 1 14 144 Tm (- Log sandbox creation failures separately for investigation.) Tj T* ET
BT 1 0 0 1 14 131 Tm (- Do not trust any output the sandbox process writes outside of stdout/stderr.) Tj T* ET
BT 1 0 0 1 14 118 Tm (- Consider Docker with seccomp profiles, gVisor, Firecracker, or similar hardening.) Tj T* ET
