BT 1 0 0 1 14 162 Tm (- Running user code inside the Spring Boot API server.) Tj T* ET
BT 1 0 0 1 14 149 Tm (- Making POST /submissions wait for all test cases to finish.) Tj T* ET
BT 1 0 0 1 14 136 Tm (- Not using sandbox isolation at all.) Tj T* ET
BT 1 0 0 1 14 123 Tm (- Not enforcing time and memory limits, letting code run forever.) Tj T* ET
BT 1 0 0 1 14 110 Tm (- Exposing hidden test case inputs through any API endpoint.) Tj T* ET
BT 1 0 0 1 14 97 Tm (- Storing only the final verdict with no per-test-case breakdown.) Tj T* ET
BT 1 0 0 1 14 84 Tm (- Not handling worker crashes; submissions stuck in RUNNING forever.) Tj T* ET
BT 1 0 0 1 14 71 Tm (- Mixing SYSTEM_ERROR with user code errors \(TLE, WA, RUNTIME_ERROR\).) Tj T* ET
BT 1 0 0 1 14 58 Tm (- Updating the contest leaderboard synchronously inside the submission flow.) Tj T* ET
BT 1 0 0 1 14 45 Tm (- Not rate limiting submissions, allowing one user to flood the queue.) Tj T* ET
