BT 1 0 0 1 14 362 Tm (1. Open with the hard constraint. "The entire design is shaped by one requirement: we must execute untrusted) Tj T* ET
BT 1 0 0 1 14 349 Tm (user code safely, at scale." Say this first. 30 seconds.) Tj T* ET
BT 1 0 0 1 14 331 Tm (2. State the key design decisions immediately. "POST /submissions is async. Judging happens in isolated) Tj T* ET
BT 1 0 0 1 14 318 Tm (workers. The queue absorbs contest spikes." Three sentences, 30 seconds.) Tj T* ET
BT 1 0 0 1 14 300 Tm (3. Draw the architecture. Client ) Tj /F5 9 Tf 10.8 TL (\256) Tj /F1 9 Tf 10.8 TL ( API Gateway ) Tj /F5 9 Tf 10.8 TL (\256) Tj /F1 9 Tf 10.8 TL ( Submission Service ) Tj /F5 9 Tf 10.8 TL (\256) Tj /F1 9 Tf 10.8 TL ( Queue ) Tj /F5 9 Tf 10.8 TL (\256) Tj /F1 9 Tf 10.8 TL ( Judge Workers ) Tj /F5 9 Tf 10.8 TL (\256) Tj /F1 9 Tf 10.8 TL T* ET
BT 1 0 0 1 14 287 Tm (Sandbox ) Tj /F5 9 Tf 10.8 TL (\256) Tj /F1 9 Tf 10.8 TL ( DB. Show Object Storage for code and test cases. 2 minutes.) Tj T* ET
BT 1 0 0 1 14 269 Tm (4. Walk through the submission flow. Submit ) Tj /F5 9 Tf 10.8 TL (\256) Tj /F1 9 Tf 10.8 TL ( QUEUED ) Tj /F5 9 Tf 10.8 TL (\256) Tj /F1 9 Tf 10.8 TL ( Worker picks it up ) Tj /F5 9 Tf 10.8 TL (\256) Tj /F1 9 Tf 10.8 TL ( Compile ) Tj /F5 9 Tf 10.8 TL (\256) Tj /F1 9 Tf 10.8 TL ( Run test cases) Tj T* ET
BT 1 0 0 1 14 256 Tm /F5 9 Tf 10.8 TL (\256) Tj /F1 9 Tf 10.8 TL ( Verdict ) Tj /F5 9 Tf 10.8 TL (\256) Tj /F1 9 Tf 10.8 TL ( User notified. Mention the state machine naturally. 2 minutes.) Tj T* ET
BT 1 0 0 1 14 238 Tm (5. Explain the sandbox. No network, CPU and memory limits, destroyed after execution. Workers are on) Tj T* ET
BT 1 0 0 1 14 225 Tm (separate machines from the API. Test cases never exposed through APIs. This is what separates a serious) Tj T* ET
BT 1 0 0 1 14 212 Tm (answer from a shallow one. 1.5 minutes.) Tj T* ET
BT 1 0 0 1 14 194 Tm (6. Cover one failure. Worker crashes mid-run. Kafka offset not committed. Submission goes back to the queue.) Tj T* ET
BT 1 0 0 1 14 181 Tm (Retry with a different worker. 1 minute.) Tj T* ET
BT 1 0 0 1 14 163 Tm (7. Close with one tradeoff. Single queue vs separate queues per language, or stop-on-first-failure vs) Tj T* ET
BT 1 0 0 1 14 150 Tm (run-all-tests. Pick one and explain it clearly. 1.5 minutes.) Tj T* ET
