BT 1 0 0 1 14 76 Tm (isolated workers. Sandboxes enforce CPU, memory, and network limits. The queue protects the system from) Tj T* ET
BT 1 0 0 1 14 63 Tm (contest traffic spikes. The tradeoff is between isolation strength and execution speed, and between operational) Tj T* ET
BT 1 0 0 1 14 50 Tm (simplicity and language fairness across separate queues.) Tj T* ET
