BT 1 0 0 1 0 58 Tm /F1 10 Tf 17 TL .913516 Tw (Every heartbeat just refreshes the TTL on these keys. If the app stops sending heartbeats for any reason,) Tj T* 0 Tw 1.057608 Tw (Redis quietly expires the key on its own, nobody has to run a job to notice the user vanished. That is the) Tj T* 0 Tw 1.576654 Tw (entire trick behind why this scales. For multi device users, the user stays marked online as long as one) Tj T* 0 Tw (device key is alive, and last_seen is written only once, at the moment the very last device's key disappears.) Tj T* ET
