BT 1 0 0 1 0 92 Tm /F1 10 Tf 17 TL 2.420697 Tw (CONNECTING means the socket passed authentication but we have not seen a stable heartbeat yet.) Tj T* 0 Tw -0.122235 Tw (ONLINE means a live heartbeat exists in Redis right now. STALE means the heartbeat is missing but the TTL) Tj T* 0 Tw 1.615318 Tw (grace window has not fully closed, this absorbs short network blips without flipping someone's status on) Tj T* 0 Tw .593984 Tw (every train tunnel. OFFLINE_PENDING fires when one device disappears but other devices still need to be) Tj T* 0 Tw .796412 Tw (checked before deciding the user is really gone. OFFLINE_CONFIRMED is the only point where last_seen) Tj T* 0 Tw (actually gets written.) Tj T* ET
